# ===========================================
# PUBLIC REPO SAFETY NET (last line of defense)
# ===========================================
# The sync script uses a WHITELIST-ONLY approach:
# only explicitly approved files go to public.
# These .gitignore rules are a backup safety net
# in case of accidental direct git pushes.
#
# The private repo sync IGNORES .gitignore and
# uses its own file walker.
# ===========================================

